{
  "title": "论坛",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1 style=\"font-weight: bold;\">论坛</h1>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">论坛允许就任何话题进行安全的社交讨论。论坛包含条目和已保存的搜索。<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">论坛不包含其他论坛，但包含针对特定话题的讨论。</span></p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/forums.jpg\"></h2>\n  <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_title\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    \n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n      <p class=\"Content_body\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">点击</span>        <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; font-weight: bold;\">论坛</span>        <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">会显示所有包含条目中的聚合消息。</span>        <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">点击论坛内的某个条目或已保存的搜索，将仅显示该条目的消息内容。</span></p>\n      \n      <ul style=\"list-style: disc;\">\n        <li>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\">个人</p>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\">与特定用户和组共享</p>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <p class=\"Bulleted_list\">对所有人可用</p>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"Content_body\" style=\"font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">要了解有关论坛的更多信息，请参阅以下主题：</span></p>\n      <p class=\"Content_body\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">添</span>加论坛</a></p>\n      <p class=\"Content_body\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">将已保存的搜索添加到论坛</a></p>\n      <p class=\"Content_body\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">论坛权限</a></p>\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Forums.htm"
}